# C0 localhost — live streams + deploy

## What Rob does (dashboard only)

- **Dashboard:** http://localhost:3000/ — Broadcast tab (TV/Grid), Calendar (schedule)
- Start/stop streams from the UI — same buttons as before
- If Twitch goes offline: Broadcast → start ClipzWorld TV again (or wait for scheduler). Not operator error — usually a bad agent restart before sidecar existed
- **Owner calendar PIN:** `1010` (overrides only)
- Rob does **not** run terminals — agents run all commands

When an agent says "deploy" or "restart server", Rob says:

> Use `bash scripts/deploy_c0.sh` only — do not restart broadcast-sidecar.

## Two pm2 processes

| Process | Role | Agent may restart? |
|---------|------|-------------------|
| `broadcast-sidecar` | Twitch TV + YouTube Live ffmpeg | **NO** while on air (unless intentionally stopping streams) |
| `auraflux` | Dashboard + pipeline API | **YES** via `deploy_c0.sh` when loading new code |

With sidecar running, streams **survive** an `auraflux` restart.

## Code deploys / new routes

```bash
bash scripts/deploy_c0.sh
```

- Restarts **auraflux only**; checks sidecar health first
- **NEVER** `pm2 restart all`
- **NEVER** `pm2 restart broadcast-sidecar` (kills live ffmpeg mid-stream)
- **NEVER** raw `pm2 restart auraflux` during live stream **without** sidecar running (old behavior — stream dies)

`safe_restart.sh` = full auraflux restart when pipeline is idle (no assembly). Sidecar-owned streams still survive if sidecar is up.

## ClipzWorld TV

Transformative VOD loop only (Bobby G + news). **Not** raw Twitch grid rebroadcast.

## If Twitch is offline

1. Confirm `broadcast-sidecar` is online (`pm2 list`)
2. Start TV from **Broadcast** dashboard (curated ~1hr preset)
3. Do **not** restart sidecar unless starting fresh

Rob checks Twitch/dashboard only. Agent runs the steps above.

## End of session

```bash
# cwn-c0 work:
bash scripts/aider_session_review_local.sh

# always (from cwn-production repo):
bash scripts/session_close.sh
```

## Agent must NOT

| Don't | Why |
|-------|-----|
| `pm2 restart all` | Can kill sidecar and drop Twitch |
| `pm2 restart broadcast-sidecar` | Kills live ffmpeg mid-stream |
| Ask Rob to restart, edit `.env`, or run `curl` | Dashboard-only operator |
